{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/152127c08ab43b823b9ab1aa8e89a809.poster.avif?t=1767779964\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/152127c08ab43b823b9ab1aa8e89a809.webm?t=1767779964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/152127c08ab43b823b9ab1aa8e89a809.mp4?t=1767779964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture past the wall and retrieve valuable loot to expand your base. Be sure to bring a sword. Your neighbours aren't exactly the friendliest of company, hahah. But no, seriously, they will absolutely kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/43e4b692ae8729e50bf522de10ff6e35.poster.avif?t=1767779964\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/43e4b692ae8729e50bf522de10ff6e35.webm?t=1767779964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/43e4b692ae8729e50bf522de10ff6e35.mp4?t=1767779964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrive in the world of Sunny Shores. Explore classic survival mechanics, where every decision you make leads to either a mediocre experience or a slightly less mediocre experience (possibilities in between are endless).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/f28799a0da5a125d0220eb201d57dc9d.poster.avif?t=1767779964\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/f28799a0da5a125d0220eb201d57dc9d.webm?t=1767779964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/f28799a0da5a125d0220eb201d57dc9d.mp4?t=1767779964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends, or play with yourself. Now with multiplayer capabilities, explore, build and\u00a0craft together to survive in an infinite sandbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789870?t=1767779964","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/d8751343efc1e1c1b6ab9eb91350fdf8bff1f2ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767779964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/4ec3015f650a84a4becd5e25b52557a29b9815a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767779964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/4ec3015f650a84a4becd5e25b52557a29b9815a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767779964","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789870/extras/152127c08ab43b823b9ab1aa8e89a809.poster.avif?t=1767779964\" width=1170 height=328 ><source 